  "integration_grant": "Android Host-Totals: read existing successful StorageStats/AnalyzeApi producer and analyze_platform; only sys.rs/HostMonitor own bridge to analytics::remember_platform_totals. Preserve client/remote separation. Ask parent before changing producer files.",
  "storage_cancel_grant": "Only targeted process-local Weak<AtomicBool> registration for active background jobs requiring platform::requires_storage_access endpoints; set_storage_access(false) cancels those immediately, not remote/remote or app-private jobs. Keep supervisor, states, retries and pending-generation semantics. No unrelated daemon changes.",
  "parser_extraction_grant": "Only extract shared platform_totals JSON parser into own sys_platform module and delegate existing analyze_platform parser; retain AnalyzeApi semantics/budgets/tests and no client-remote totals mixing.",
  "initial_access_grant": "Only move existing requires_storage_access denial ahead of initial cancel check; midrun cancellation remains cancellation with pending work preserved.",
  "event_registration_grant": "Only additive SyncProblem(jobId,title,text) and syncProblem decoder; preserve other Core events and bounded payload errors."
